OL,3,GNEWSAArran ferry evacuated over 'bomb
OL,4,Athreat' as passenger rescued from sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalMac's Arran ferry service has been
OL,7,Fevacuated over a bomb threat after a
OL,8,Fpassenger was rescued from the water.
OL,10,FThe ferry operator said a person was
OL,11,Freported overboard on the MV Caledonian
OL,12,FIsles 16:40 sailing from Brodick to
OL,13,FArdrossan.
OL,15,FThe vessel's fast rescue craft was
OL,16,Flaunched to recover the person. The BBC
OL,17,Funderstands that they then claimed
OL,18,Fthere was a bomb on board.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
