OL,3,GNEWSAArran ferry evacuated over 'bomb
OL,4,Athreat' as passenger rescued from sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalMac said emergency protocols were
OL,7,Fput in place. The ferry was fully
OL,8,Fsearched and 329 passengers removed on
OL,9,Ffoot when it berthed at Ardrossan.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
